- Add comprehensive kernel-doc explaining fault register access paths
- Convert platform_device_id to named initializers (`.name =`, `.driver_data =`)
  https://lore.kernel.org/all/cover.1778582187.git.u.kleine-koenig@baylibre.com/
changes v11:
